// The design of the base-scale conformance plan (LLP 1121 stage 11): its own
// space.md, which wins over the scale's app-wide (ruling 4); space.header, a
// name the scale does not reserve, which keeps the app's meaning (ruling 5);
// and the probe's two colours, fixed in either scheme, which the hosts'
// corners are read against.
tamber scale

theme
  space.md = 12px
  space.header = 44px
  probe.fill = #0000ff  scheme=fixed
  probe.ground = #ffffff  scheme=fixed
